OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will
OL,6,Fremain cloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with further outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain, these turning heavier and more
OL,9,Fpersistent from the south overnight.
OL,10,FEast or southeasterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy with occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy rain spreading north through the
OL,14,Fmorning.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,17,FUnsettled on Wednesday with further
OL,18,Fshowers or longer spells of rain,
OL,19,Foften heavy at times. Brighter on
OL,20,FThursday with a few scattered showers.
